{"CDN support is present but not wired through config; GetWebAssets uses a hard-coded empty CDN URL, preventing enabling CDN for assets in tests and at runtime": 0.5625938177108765, "EntryPointAssets struct mutation pattern via SetContentDeliveryURL may not be thread-safe when objects are cached and reused - callers could mutate cached shared instances": 0.6684097051620483, "Global cache entryPointAssetsCache returns a pointer to cached dtos.EntryPointAssets which exposes mutating method SetContentDeliveryURL, creating data race risk in concurrent environment when callers mutate the cached pointer": 0.7820655703544617, "CDN fetch path in readWebAssetsFromCDN uses http.DefaultClient.Do with no explicit timeout, potentially blocking indefinitely if CDN is slow or unresponsive": 0.6868426203727722, "Recovery.go swallows error from GetWebAssets call, hiding CDN/file load failures and reducing observability of outages or misconfigurations": 0.0667724683880806, "TestReadWebassetsFromCDN test is skipped, meaning CDN path behavior is not exercised by tests and could regress without notice": 0.11682239174842834, "CDN URL config flag in defaults.ini may not be properly wired into the code path that fetches assets from CDN": 0.20158427953720093, "Typo in error message: 'asssets-manifest' should be 'assets-manifest'": 0.13450086116790771}